    "id": "fever-guidance-demo-01-0",
    "text": "Section 1: Fever basics. Fever is a common sign of infection or illness. A mild fever may improve with rest, fluids, and monitoring. Regularly assess temperature and symptoms, and avoid relying on a single reading alone when the person appears well.",
